      <!-- Ví dụ 12, 13, 14 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-6">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 text-lg border-b pb-2 text-indigo-700">Ví dụ minh họa mẫu</h4>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="exercise-box pl-4">
            <p class="font-medium text-slate-700"><strong>Ví dụ 12:</strong> Tính $\int (1 + \cos x)\,dx$</p>
            <p class="text-emerald-700 mt-1 font-semibold">$$\int (1 + \cos x)\,dx = x + \sin x + C$$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="exercise-box pl-4">
            <p class="font-medium text-slate-700"><strong>Ví dụ 13:</strong> Tính $\int (2\sin x + 2027x)\,dx$</p>
            <p class="text-emerald-700 mt-1 font-semibold">$$\int (2\sin x + 2027x)\,dx = -2\cos x + \frac{2027}{2}x^2 + C$$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="exercise-box pl-4">
            <p class="font-medium text-slate-700"><strong>Ví dụ 14:</strong> Tính $\int \left(\sin 2x - \frac{1}{\cos^2 x}\right)dx$</p>
            <p class="text-emerald-700 mt-1 font-semibold">$$\int \left(\sin 2x - \frac{1}{\cos^2 x}\right)dx = -\frac{1}{2}\cos 2x - \tan x + C$$</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bài 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-6">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 text-lg border-b pb-2 text-indigo-700">Bài 1: Tính các nguyên hàm sau</h4>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
            <p><strong>a)</strong> $\int \frac{2\sin x}{3}\,dx = -\frac{2}{3}\cos x + C$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
            <p><strong>b)</strong> $\int (5\cos x - 3x + 1)\,dx = 5\sin x - \frac{3}{2}x^2 + x + C$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
            <p><strong>c)</strong> $\int \left(3\cos x - \frac{4}{x}\right)dx = 3\sin x - 4\ln|x| + C$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
            <p><strong>d)</strong> $\int 2\sin \frac{x}{2}\cos \frac{x}{2}\,dx = \int \sin x\,dx = -\cos x + C$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg md:col-span-2">
            <p><strong>e)</strong> $\int \left(\frac{3}{\cos^2 x} + \frac{1}{x} - x^2\right)dx = 3\tan x + \ln|x| - \frac{x^3}{3} + C$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg md:col-span-2">
            <p><strong>f)</strong> $\int \left(e^x + 2^{3x+2} - \frac{1}{\sin^2 x}\right)dx = e^x + \frac{2^{3x+2}}{3\ln 2} + \cot x + C$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg md:col-span-2">
            <p><strong>g)</strong> $\int \left(e^x + \cos 2026x + \frac{2027}{x^3}\right)dx = e^x + \frac{\sin 2026x}{2026} - \frac{2027}{2x^2} + C$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg md:col-span-2">
            <p><strong>h)</strong> $\int (x + \tan^2 x)\,dx = \int \left(x + \frac{1}{\cos^2 x} - 1\right)dx = \frac{x^2}{2} + \tan x - x + C$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
            <p><strong>k)</strong> $\int (5\cos x - 3\sin x)\,dx = 5\sin x + 3\cos x + C$</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
            <p><strong>l)</strong> $\int \left(e^{x-2} - \frac{2}{\sin^2 x}\right)dx = e^{x-2} + 2\cot x + C$</p>
