          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Bài 1: Tính các nguyên hàm sau</h4>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-700">
            <li><strong>a)</strong> $\int x(x^3 - 2x + 5)\,dx = \int (x^4 - 2x^2 + 5x)\,dx = \frac{x^5}{5} - \frac{2x^3}{3} + \frac{5x^2}{2} + C$</li>
            <li><strong>b)</strong> $\int (x^2 - 1)^2\,dx = \int (x^4 - 2x^2 + 1)\,dx = \frac{x^5}{5} - \frac{2x^3}{3} + x + C$</li>
            <li><strong>c)</strong> $\int \frac{x^2 + 3x - 1}{x}\,dx = \int \left(x + 3 - \frac{1}{x}\right)dx = \frac{x^2}{2} + 3x - \ln|x| + C$</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t pt-4">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Bài 2: Tính các nguyên hàm sau</h4>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-700">
            <li><strong>a)</strong> $\int x(2x - 3)^2\,dx = \int (4x^3 - 12x^2 + 9x)\,dx = x^4 - 4x^3 + \frac{9}{2}x^2 + C$</li>
            <li><strong>b)</strong> $\int \sin^2 \frac{x}{2}\,dx = \int \frac{1 - \cos x}{2}\,dx = \frac{1}{2}x - \frac{1}{2}\sin x + C$</li>
            <li><strong>c)</strong> $\int \tan^2 x\,dx = \int \left(\frac{1}{\cos^2 x} - 1\right)dx = \tan x - x + C$</li>
            <li><strong>d)</strong> $\int 2^{3x} \cdot 3^x\,dx = \int 24^x\,dx = \frac{24^x}{\ln 24} + C$</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t pt-4">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Bài 3: Tìm nguyên hàm thỏa mãn điều kiện ban đầu</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Tìm $F(x)$ của $f(x) = \frac{1}{\sin^2 x}$ thỏa mãn $F\left(\frac{\pi}{2}\right) = 1$.</p>
          <div class="mt-2 bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded text-sm text-slate-800">
            Ta có: $F(x) = \int \frac{1}{\sin^2 x}\,dx = -\cot x + C$.<br>
            Thay $x = \frac{\pi}{2} \Rightarrow F\left(\frac{\pi}{2}\right) = -\cot \frac{\pi}{2} + C = 0 + C = 1 \Rightarrow C = 1$.<br>
            <strong>Kết luận:</strong> $F(x) = -\cot x + 1$.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t pt-4">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Bài 4:</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Tìm $F(x)$ của $f(x) = \sin x + \cos x$ thỏa mãn $F\left(\frac{\pi}{2}\right) = 2$.</p>
          <div class="mt-2 bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded text-sm text-slate-800">
            Ta có: $F(x) = \int (\sin x + \cos x)\,dx = -\cos x + \sin x + C$.<br>
            Thay $x = \frac{\pi}{2} \Rightarrow -\cos \frac{\pi}{2} + \sin \frac{\pi}{2} + C = 2 \Rightarrow 0 + 1 + C = 2 \Rightarrow C = 1$.<br>
            <strong>Kết luận:</strong> $F(x) = -\cos x + \sin x + 1$.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION III -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-800 bg-blue-50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg mb-6 border border-blue-100 flex items-center gap-2">
